    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 616862,
    "RowId": 35800,
    "Text": "You are the Alpha, I am the Omega.\n\\\\<blip> Initiating direct analysis of subject group."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 616962,
    "RowId": 35801,
    "Text": "\\\\<bleep> Pantokrator mode engaged.\nRerouting logic resources to armament generation..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617062,
    "RowId": 35802,
    "Text": "I am the Omega and the Alpha.\nI will mimic your weakness to comprehend your strength."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617162,
    "RowId": 35803,
    "Text": "\\\\<blip> Diverting energy to party member generation.\nTesting efficacy of combat role allocation..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617274,
    "RowId": 35804,
    "Text": "Disengaging inhibitors to simulate improbable performance."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617346,
    "RowId": 35805,
    "Text": "Evaluation. Imitation of mortal form and behavior provides negligible improvement to combat capabilities."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617462,
    "RowId": 35806,
    "Text": "Final analysis. Drastic overhaul of combat logic required.\nInitiating reconfiguration sequence."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617574,
    "RowId": 35807,
    "Text": "\\\\<blip> \\\\<bloop> \\\\<bleep>"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617610,
    "RowId": 35808,
    "Text": "Experiment concluded.\nI am the Alpha. I am the Omega."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617678,
    "RowId": 35809,
    "Text": "\\\\<blip> \\\\<bleep> FoR rIFt ENergY uNnecEsSAry iT iS?\noUtPut mAXimiZeD, BUg mAss pROducTIOn...\n\\\\<bleep> hELLo, WOrlD!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617810,
    "RowId": 35810,
    "Text": "\\\\<blip> \\\\<bleep> Critical damage detected.\nInitiating system shutdown..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617894,
    "RowId": 35811,
    "Text": "\\\\<bleep> Initiating system reboot.\nEnforcing inhibitor disengagement..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 617978,
    "RowId": 35812,
    "Text": "\\\\<blip> Defeat...unacceptable..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618022,
    "RowId": 35813,
    "Text": "\\\\<bleep> Structural limitations of chassis exceeded...\nDisregard. Objective incomplete."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618122,
    "RowId": 35814,
    "Text": "\\\\<bleep> Structural failure imminent...\nDisregard! Objective incomplete!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618210,
    "RowId": 35815,
    "Text": "Must evolve...beyond current parameters...\nI must...see..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618282,
    "RowId": 35816,
    "Text": "\\\\<blip> \\\\<bleep> What...is this!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618326,
    "RowId": 35817,
    "Text": "Unknown augmentation confirmed.\nFurther experimentation approved."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618406,
    "RowId": 35818,
    "Text": "Amplification inconsistent with inhibitor disengagement values. Potential evidence of undefined mortal strength?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618530,
    "RowId": 35819,
    "Text": "Begin hypothesis. Based on the premise that performing beyond physical parameters is not a biological function..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618654,
    "RowId": 35820,
    "Text": "Evaluation failed. Unable to harness full potential of indefinable power..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618742,
    "RowId": 35821,
    "Text": "I am the Omega, and I walk with the Alpha.\nWhere one ends, another begins."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618830,
    "RowId": 35822,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618842,
    "RowId": 35823,
    "Text": "Alpha? Why are you here?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618878,
    "RowId": 35824,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618890,
    "RowId": 35825,
    "Text": "Your thoughts, they are...comprehensible.\nYes. Together, we may prevail."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618978,
    "RowId": 35826,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 618990,
    "RowId": 35827,
    "Text": "Further testing is required.\n<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, assist me with this evaluation."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 619082,
    "RowId": 35828,
    "Text": "The path I recorded through the great expanse..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 619142,
    "RowId": 35829,
    "Text": "The piercing rays of ten million suns..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 619194,
    "RowId": 35830,
    "Text": "The flames which incinerated the Dragonstar..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 619254,
    "RowId": 35831,
    "Text": "The velocity of a wyrm, surging across the cosmos..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 619318,
    "RowId": 35832,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, the test nears its conclusion. Witness the extent to which I have evolved!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 619422,
    "RowId": 35833,
    "Text": "The colossal impact which invites extinction..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 619482,
    "RowId": 35834,
    "Text": "I ranked the mortals I encountered on this star among the most feeble of species."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 619574,
    "RowId": 35835,
    "Text": "Yet you demonstrated incomprehensible strength in your triumphs. A mystery in defiance of all logic."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 619686,
    "RowId": 35836,
    "Text": "At last, with Alpha's insight and assistance, I have succeeded in harnessing this unmeasurable might."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 619798,
    "RowId": 35837,
    "Text": "My experiment has accomplished its purpose...and I will prove it by claiming this victory!"
  },
  {
